  "rationale": "P1 of the committee spec for inverse flames, data-informed (not zero-shot): the carried law (D1, two thirds) and a scenario that holds a marginal flame at a high oxygen flow in a limit cycle (D5, one third); for prefixes that carry the script's planned stop, the same two with their guessed stop times switched off and the stop handed to them as a known control at the stage sum minus 0.4 s. It replaces the unregistered committee D1 of this spec, whose scenario was written in total burner flow. No member number is typed here: slot values are copied by tools/wsp/committee_edits.py. The typed numbers are the two weight vectors and the offset. No fit, no search; no validation outcome was read.",
